cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Risikoeinstufung nach EU AI Act
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as part of the SimpleAct AI Governance Framework."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: SimpleAct-Compliance
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/simpleact-ai-risk-classification-eu"
license: MIT
abstract: "A reproducible procedure for classifying AI systems under Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, applied in the order the regulation itself prescribes: AI system definition, exemptions, prohibited practices under Art. 5, high-risk under Annex I and III including the Art. 6(3) derogation and its profiling carve-out, and the Art. 50 transparency layer that applies in addition. Includes the six triggers that invalidate a classification, with emphasis on silent provider-side model changes, and the application dates as amended by the Digital Omnibus."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - risk classification
  - Annex III
  - Article 5
  - Article 6(3)
  - Article 50
  - Digital Omnibus
  - GPAI
  - AI governance
  - SimpleAct
